        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBOR19ENTR, Keyed Bordeaux Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you have ever been to old town Manhattan, then you know that a since of history can be beautiful and elegant. The Bordeaux Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset is a wonderful blend of modern silhouettes and old world materials to make a front door lock that is breathtaking. This Clear Crystal Door Knob has a single cylinder Schlage C Keyway--one of the most well-known locks in the industry--for security. It is easy to install and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. The Keyed Bordeaux Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is 11 inches tall and 2-5/8 inches wide, for a sleek appearance once installed. Choose from a wide array of finish options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/bordeaux-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favbor19\"><b>Bordeaux Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Bordeaux Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Bordeaux Crystal Knob with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBOR19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262394\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBOR19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
